# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the traditional workflow {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"
msgstr "기존 워크플로와 비교 {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [fermionic circuits](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation) guide describes how the traditional workflow performs fermion-to-qubit encoding *before* building the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Compare the two approaches:\n"
msgstr "[페르미온 회로](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation) 가이드는 기존 워크플로가 [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)을 만들기 *전에* 페르미온-큐비트 인코딩을 수행하는 방법을 설명합니다. 두 접근 방식을 비교해 보세요.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The directly constructed QuantumCircuit of the fermionic time evolution.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/transpilation-4.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The directly constructed QuantumCircuit of the fermionic time evolution.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/transpilation-4.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both workflows produce equivalent circuits. However, the traditional workflow requires you to implement optimization steps manually, whereas with the fermionic-first approach you can integrate problem-aware optimizations into the transpilation process.\n"
msgstr "두 워크플로 모두 동등한 회로를 만듭니다. 다만 기존 워크플로에서는 최적화 단계를 직접 구현해야 하는 반면, 페르미온 우선 접근 방식에서는 문제 인식 최적화를 트랜스파일 과정에 통합할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced workflows {#advanced-workflows}"
msgstr "고급 워크플로 {#advanced-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset pass manager provides a convenient starting point. For more advanced use cases, you can do the following:\n"
msgstr "프리셋 패스 매니저는 편리한 출발점을 제공합니다. 더 고급 사용 사례에서는 다음을 할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customize the transpiler passes run during each stage.\n"
msgstr "각 단계에서 실행되는 트랜스파일러 패스를 사용자 지정합니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the product formula that Trotterizes an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate in fermionic space, either per gate or for a whole pipeline with [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation)).\n"
msgstr "[`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") 게이트를 페르미온 공간에서 트로터화하는 곱 공식을 게이트별로, 또는 [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\")로 파이프라인 전체에 대해 선택합니다([페르미온 공간에서 Evolution 게이트 합성하기](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation) 참고).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implement custom fermion-to-qubit mappings by creating synthesis plugins (see [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\")).\n"
msgstr "합성 플러그인을 만들어 사용자 지정 페르미온-큐비트 매핑을 구현합니다([`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\") 참고).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build custom transpiler passes.\n"
msgstr "사용자 지정 트랜스파일러 패스를 만듭니다.\n"
